OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1790081307
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 6 Oct to Tue 20 OctFThe
OL,6,Fchangeable and unsettled weather is
OL,7,Flikely to continue, with wet and windy
OL,8,Fweather even perhaps become more
OL,9,Ffrequent. As is often the case for
OL,10,FOctober, deeper areas of low pressure
OL,11,Fmay also bring periods of very strong
OL,12,Fwinds, especially across north and
OL,13,Fwest. There is no reliable signal for
OL,14,Fany long-lasting settled weather, but
OL,15,Ffair days are likely between weather
OL,16,Fsystems, especially in the south and
OL,17,Feast. Temperatures are expected to
OL,18,Fremain generally above average
OL,19,Foverall, although cooler interludes
OL,20,Fare possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
